t: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>아이디가 yjhwang인 해당 필드를 보기</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-sql line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-sql\">mysql<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token keyword\">select</span> id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>tel <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">where</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'yjhwang'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>신수진의 나이를 27세로 수정</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-sql line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-sql\">mysql<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token keyword\">update</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">set</span> age<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">27</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">where</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'신수진'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>이름이 신수진인 해당 필드를 보기</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-sql line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-sql\">mysql<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token keyword\">select</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>age <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">where</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'신수진'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>이현우의 나이를 30세로, 전화번호를 786-057로 수정</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-sql line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-sql\">mysql<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token keyword\">update</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">set</span> age<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">30</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>tel<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'786-057'</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">where</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'이현우'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>이름이 이현우인 해당 필드를 보기</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-sql line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-sql\">mysql<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token keyword\">select</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>age<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>tel <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">where</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'이현우'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"레코드-삭제-명령\" style=\"position:relative;\">레코드 삭제 명령<a href=\"#%EB%A0%88%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C-%EC%82%AD%EC%A0%9C-%EB%AA%85%EB%A0%B9\" aria-label=\"레코드 삭제 명령 permalink\" class=\"anchor cu